 kit status - shows where the work stands, from backlog to releases

   required
   --no-fetch [--text | --json | --jq] [--all | [--mine] [--others] [--owner=<login>…]]
   --stages                  prints the stages the picture draws, one per line, in order
   backlog                   the open issues no pull request closes, oldest first
   incoming                  what the fetch brought: default-branch commits, branches new and gone
   worktrees                 the desk and every worktree: branch, ahead and behind, uncommitted
                             paths
   changes                   the open pull requests, each with the issues it closes
   releases                  the releases on the forge, newest first


 kit status
